# F11-14 worked example: a plant-watering robot with a phone app.
title Plant-watering robot
external user    Gardener
process  phone   Phone app
process  cloud   Relay service [auth]
store    cloud   Schedule store
process  home    Robot controller
store    home    Watering log [log]
flow Gardener -> Phone app : taps
flow Phone app -> Relay service : schedule [enc]
flow Relay service -> Schedule store : schedule
flow Schedule store -> Relay service : schedule
flow Relay service -> Robot controller : schedule [enc]
flow Robot controller -> Watering log : events
flow Robot controller -> Relay service : status [enc]
